{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Call of the Golden Valley",
    "steam_appid": 2131660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/68931c97c53e33890d62c3dbb88d2731.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unexpected turn of events has landed you, an American woman, in the mysterious Australian High Country searching for your missing friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow clues, solve puzzles, and delve into conspiracy theories to investigate not only her disappearance, but the strange and inexplicable mystery surrounding many missing hikers drawn to the mountains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/57774e60f06c30303e08d15f1b2bafac.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the sleepy small town of Phillipston, your investigation must uncover clues using both good old-fashioned detective tricks combined with the modern-art of internet stalking. Follow the crumbs and get lost in the theories surrounding this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/f444c3e1803853a695c2716d4347413c.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We respect your detective skills, so it\u2019s all up to you to make the final logical leaps. Set the poetry in motion by linking your observations on your deduction board to ultimately reveal exactly what has transpired. A series of unrelated misadventures? Or something more sinister\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/6e7cdf90d15b03e2d1d981154ba11d1f.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What would drive someone to venture alone into the harsh landscape of a country known for its deadly wilderness? Delve into the psychology of the characters to understand what they\u2019ve done and why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/29712aabce88b1cd72c72b63cb0e55d4.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be transported to the High Country of Victoria, Australia, with undulating rugged mountains, towering eucalyptus trees, infamous wildlife, and quick-witted banter loving local characters. Developed in Australia, we\u2019ve taken every step to give you the real deal; from sound recordings and reference images taken directly from the bush, to testing out the best vanilla slices in country town bakeries.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/68931c97c53e33890d62c3dbb88d2731.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unexpected turn of events has landed you, an American woman, in the mysterious Australian High Country searching for your missing friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow clues, solve puzzles, and delve into conspiracy theories to investigate not only her disappearance, but the strange and inexplicable mystery surrounding many missing hikers drawn to the mountains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/57774e60f06c30303e08d15f1b2bafac.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the sleepy small town of Phillipston, your investigation must uncover clues using both good old-fashioned detective tricks combined with the modern-art of internet stalking. Follow the crumbs and get lost in the theories surrounding this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/f444c3e1803853a695c2716d4347413c.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We respect your detective skills, so it\u2019s all up to you to make the final logical leaps. Set the poetry in motion by linking your observations on your deduction board to ultimately reveal exactly what has transpired. A series of unrelated misadventures? Or something more sinister\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/6e7cdf90d15b03e2d1d981154ba11d1f.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What would drive someone to venture alone into the harsh landscape of a country known for its deadly wilderness? Delve into the psychology of the characters to understand what they\u2019ve done and why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/29712aabce88b1cd72c72b63cb0e55d4.avif?t=1753317061\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be transported to the High Country of Victoria, Australia, with undulating rugged mountains, towering eucalyptus trees, infamous wildlife, and quick-witted banter loving local characters. Developed in Australia, we\u2019ve taken every step to give you the real deal; from sound recordings and reference images taken directly from the bush, to testing out the best vanilla slices in country town bakeries.</p>",
    "short_description": "Become a detective and delve into the depths of desire and motivation to solve the mystery of vanishing hikers in the Australian bush. Follow clues, solve puzzles, dive into conspiracy theories, and find your missing friend.",
